msgctxt "64"
msgid "You're gonna get it this time, you stupid mutt!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr "Fermo!"

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Izumi. This dog a friend of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Ahhh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Get back!"
msgstr "Stai indietro!"

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Wait!"
msgstr "Aspetta!"

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Come back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "You're not getting away that easy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Oh, shit! I know where that dog's from!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Language, Mikio. Now tell me about this dog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Well, he used to live over at an izakaya in Hatsumachi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Quiet little fella back then. Not the maniac he is now.\r\n"
"Honestly, he's so outta his mind I didn't even recognize\r\n"
"him at first. But he's definitely the same dog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"The guy who ran that place shipped on up to Tokyo a while\r\n"
"ago, though. Guess he just abandoned the dog..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Hey, didn't you used to have a dog of your own, Izumi-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Can I go look for the dog, Uncle Kaz? Please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Just wait. I'm sure he'll come back eventually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "No, I'm gonna go find him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "...All right. You want a hand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Yes please!"
msgstr "Sì. Ti prego!"

msgctxt "400"
msgid "No luck, boys?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Naw, he got away... That's the fastest dog I've ever seen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "You're just slow, Taichi! I totally could've caught him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Oh yeah? Then why didn't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "That's enough, you two. Where'd the dog go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "He sprinted off toward town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Well, looks like we're going on a little field trip then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr "Va bene!"

msgctxt "496"
msgid "You're really gonna go after it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Yup. You two want to join?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Nah, I'm pooped."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Me too. I'm sick of chasing dogs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "I'm coming!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"How 'bout me and Izumi go take a peek over on Ryukyu\r\n"
"Boulevard? You can check out Hatsumachi, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Mi sembra una buona idea."

msgctxt "580"
msgid "C'mon, Izumi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Coming!"
msgstr "Arrivo!"

